-- One-time doctor photo refresh (applied on the VM by deploy-vm.yml, marker-guarded).
--
-- Source: a new studio set supplied by the clinic (300 files). Each portrait was
-- a transparent cut-out; every one was composited onto solid WHITE and downscaled
-- to <=1600px before upload, so no delivery format can reintroduce the black
-- backdrop that transparent originals produced under f_auto.
--
-- 209 doctors matched a file by name (surname-guarded fuzzy match; three
-- wrong matches were rejected rather than risk showing the wrong person).
-- Photos are on Cloudinary cloud `ubhucgne` under doctors/<slug>.

